# Phase 5 T-U1 (Ctrl-O tool rows wrap, fx 427d481f/6f071dea/78424464): one
# tool group in full-access mode -- a long command (wider than 120 columns,
# running 12 s) and five reads in one step, then the answer. Ctrl-O while the
# command runs (the heading clipped on c1db919, wrapped under the rail on
# v0.0.16), a page up, and the same view after the command settles and the
# page rebuilds (026a8f4e/b1a53b01). fx's second step calls two subagents
# (the `request` wrapper, df0878eb); xfx has no subagent tool, so its turns
# skip that step. The tools are each product's own: fx's `shell`/`run` is
# xfx's `terminal`/`exec`. TZ=UTC on both, so v0.0.16's local-time header
# (c9bc4876, T-U5) reads UTC as xfx's does.
fx: gateway p5-transcript-tools-turns.json
xfx: gateway p5-transcript-tools-xfx.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
env TZ=UTC
work p5-transcript-ws
wait 4
type check the files
wait 1
key Enter
wait 5
snap running
key C-o
wait 2
snap full-running
key PPage
wait 1
snap full-pgup
wait 14
snap full-pgup-after
key C-o
wait 1
snap end
snapfull end
key C-o
wait 2
snap full-tail
key Up Up Up Up
wait 1
snap full-tail-up4
key C-o
wait 1
gwlog
